 * to fit according to their `flex-shrink` value. Each flex line's [negative free
 * space](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Flexible_box_layout/Controlling_flex_item_ratios#positive_and_negative_free_space)
 * is distributed between the line's flex items that have a `flex-shrink` value greater than `0`.
 *
 * Initial: 1. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: not accepted.
